 pf-heading-1-h3">Siapa yang Kami Layani</h3><div style="--cl3-cols-xs:1;--cl3-gap-xs:16px;--cl3-peek-xs:0;--cl3-fill-xs:0;--cl3-cols-sm:2;--cl3-gap-sm:20px;--cl3-peek-sm:0;--cl3-fill-sm:0;--cl3-cols-md:5;--cl3-gap-md:24px;--cl3-peek-md:0;--cl3-fill-md:0;--cl3-cols-lg:5;--cl3-gap-lg:24px;--cl3-peek-lg:0;--cl3-fill-lg:0" data-pf-type="ContentList3" class="sc-dQEsWe bUymvf pf-85_"><div class="pf-cl3-items"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bJBfJu cOSqLB rid-6"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-87_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-88_ pf-heading-1-h3">Fishing Store</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-90_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Lengkapi rak toko Anda dengan produk pancing berkualitas yang membuat pelanggan kembali lagi.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bJBfJu cOSqLB rid-7"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-94_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-95_ pf-heading-1-h3">Reseller</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-97_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Kembangkan bisnis reseller Anda dengan pasokan produk yang andal dan margin yang menguntungkan.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bJBfJu cOSqLB rid-8"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-101_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-102_ pf-heading-1-h3">Marketplace Seller</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-104_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Tingkatkan penjualan toko online Anda dengan produk pancing yang laris di berbagai marketplace.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bJBfJu cOSqLB rid-9"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-108_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-109_ pf-heading-1-h3">Distributor & Dealer</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-111_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Perluas jaringan distribusi Anda dengan dukungan produk dan logistik yang terpercaya.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-bJBfJu cOSqLB rid-10"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-115_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-116_ pf-heading-1-h3">Fishing Community & Organization</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-118_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Dukung kegiatan komunitas dan organisasi memancing Anda dengan produk yang tepat untuk setiap anggota.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-3fd5" data-pf-type="FlexSection" data-animation="pulse" class="sc-bHnkpz guQsTo pf-121_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-container-1"><div class="sc-eBwJYS lmIvUr pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-122_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-123_ pf-heading-1-h3">Mengapa BAITANDSTRIKE</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-125_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Empat alasan utama untuk bermitra dengan kami.</span></p><img alt="DSC06934.JPG.jpeg__PID:6f2ef49f-2049-4336-abc7-62397b6c56b0" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/DSC06934_JPG.jpg?v=1788852747&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:0.5626666666666666" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image5" class="sc-boZfnm hDlcRy pf-128_ pf-image-1 pf-bg-lazy" store="[object Object]"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-129_"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-130_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-131_ pf-heading-1-h3">01</h3><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-133_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-134_ pf-heading-1-h3">Business First</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-136_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Kami memprioritaskan kebutuhan bisnis Anda di setiap langkah, memastikan setiap keputusan mendukung pertumbuhan dan efisiensi operasional Anda.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-lbJdeI kOebwC pf-139_ pf-divider-1"></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-143_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-144_ pf-heading-1-h3">02</h3><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-146_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-147_ pf-heading-1-h3">Reliable Supply</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-149_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Pasokan produk yang konsisten dan dapat diandalkan, sehingga Anda tidak perlu khawatir tentang ketersediaan stok saat kebutuhan bisnis Anda meningkat.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-lbJdeI kOebwC pf-152_ pf-divider-1"></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-156_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-157_ pf-heading-1-h3">03</h3><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-159_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-160_ pf-heading-1-h3">Competitive Pricing</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-162_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Harga B2B yang kompetitif dirancang untuk menjaga margin Anda tetap sehat, tanpa mengorbankan kualitas produk yang Anda tawarkan.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-lbJdeI kOebwC pf-165_ pf-divider-1"></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-169_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-170_ pf-heading-1-h3">04</h3><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-bWJTsT jTkwBA pf-172_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-173_ pf-heading-1-h3">Long-Term Partnership</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-175_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Kami membangun hubungan bisnis jangka panjang yang saling menguntungkan, dengan dukungan berkelanjutan untuk membantu bisnis Anda tumbuh bersama kami.</span></p></div></div></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-4627" data-pf-type="FlexSection" data-animation="jackInTheBox" class="sc-bHnkpz guQsTo pf-178_ pf-container-1 pf-color-scheme-1"><div class="sc-eBwJYS lmIvUr pf-flex-section"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-jdkCGJ ioVpsQ pf-179_ pf-heading-1-h3">Lebih dari Sekadar Supplier</h3><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-181_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Kami percaya bahwa hubungan bisnis yang kuat dibangun di atas kepercayaan. Setiap pesanan yang Anda percayakan kepada kami adalah komitmen yang kami jaga dengan sepenuh hati — dari pengadaan hingga pengiriman, kami memastikan setiap langkah berjalan sesuai harapan Anda.</span></p><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-184_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Komunikasi yang terbuka dan jujur adalah fondasi kemitraan kami. Kami selalu siap mendengarkan kebutuhan Anda, memberikan informasi yang jelas, dan memastikan Anda selalu tahu status pesanan Anda setiap saat.</span></p><p class="sc-stwUW giqUXE pf-187_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Konsistensi adalah janji kami. Kualitas produk, ketepatan waktu pengiriman, dan pelayanan yang sama baiknya — setiap kali Anda memesan, Anda akan mendapatkan pengalaman yang sama andalnya. Itulah mengapa banyak mitra bisnis memilih untuk bertahan bersama kami.</span></p><div data-pf-type="Slideshow" class="sc-dWZrec VrAfp pf-228_"><div data-id="slider-b83d9e98-4f8d-4e13-9d5d-64f020026b88-all" class="pf-slider scrollfix" style="--ws-xs:60;--ss-xs:1;--ss-sm:2;--ss-md:3;--ss-lg:3"><div class="pf-slide"><div class="sc-iQbOXA gBBMsC pf-213_" data-pf-type="SlideshowSlide"><img alt="Cuplikan layar 2026-05-15 174243.png__PID:c16f2ef4-9f20-4933-b6ab-c762397b6c56" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/Cuplikan_layar_2026-05-15_174243.png?v=1788852746&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/Cuplikan_layar_2026-05-15_174243.png?v=1788852746&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/Cuplikan_layar_2026-05-15_174243.png?v=1788852746&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/Cuplikan_layar_2026-05-15_174243.png?v=1788852746&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/Cuplikan_layar_2026-05-15_174243.png?v=1788852746&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/Cuplikan_layar_2026-05-15_174243.png?v=1788852746&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076/files/Cuplikan_layar_2026-05-15_174243.png?v=1788852746&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0837/1195/1076